<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's LG-Caltex Oil closes CDU for maintenance.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's LG-Caltex Oil closes CDU for maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's LG-Caltex Oil Corp said it had closed down its No 3 crude distillation unit on Monday for annual maintenance.</p>
<p>The 150,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) unit is scheduled to resume operation on June 19, it said.</p>
<p>LG-Caltex, the nation's second largest refiner, has a refining capacity of 600,000 bpd.</p>
<p>Caltex is a joint venture between U.S. oil companies Chevron Corp and Texaco Inc Inc.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
